### Changes

The following files have been created and modified for **Slice S2 (timefmt)**:

1. **Created** [src/timefmt.mjs](file:///Users/mehmetozel/agy-sandbox/ctx-cli/src/timefmt.mjs) exporting the pure relative-time formatter function [formatRelative](file:///Users/mehmetozel/agy-sandbox/ctx-cli/src/timefmt.mjs#L8).
2. **Created** [test/timefmt.test.mjs](file:///Users/mehmetozel/agy-sandbox/ctx-cli/test/timefmt.test.mjs) with comprehensive unit tests checking edge cases, boundary transitions, singular/plural rules, negative durations, and UTC dates.
3. **Modified** [package.json](file:///Users/mehmetozel/agy-sandbox/ctx-cli/package.json) to change the `scripts.test` command to `node --test` (to avoid directory-argument issues on Node 24).

